{"session_id": "2dbcaaedfca04db4aae24866935c9dcc", "offset": 0, "next_offset": 780, "data": "ESP-ROM:esp32s3-20210327\r\nBuild:Mar 27 2021\r\nrst:0x1 (POWERON),boot:0x4 (SPI_FLASH_BOOT)\r\nSPIWP:0xee\r\nmode:DIO, clock div:1\r\nload:0x3fce2820,len:0xcf8\r\nload:0x403c8700,len:0xb34\r\nload:0x403cb700,len:0x2d18\r\nentry 0x403c8890\r\nE (865) i2c.master: this port has not been initialized, please initialize it first\r\nSENSOR_PROBE_START tvoc\nE (1336) i2c.master: this port has not been initialized, please initialize it first\r\nSENSOR_CHECK tvoc_iaq_before_init_nack PASS\nSENSOR_CHECK tvoc_initialization_fixed_output PASS\nSENSOR_CHECK tvoc_busy_read_nack PASS\nSENSOR_CHECK tvoc_response_crc PASS\nSENSOR_CHECK tvoc_response_consumed PASS\nSENSOR_CHECK tvoc_bad_argument_crc_nack PASS\nSENSOR_CHECK tvoc_unknown_command_nack PASS\nSENSOR_TVOC_WARMUP 0\nSENSOR_TVOC_WARMUP 1\nSENSOR_TVOC_WARMUP 2\n", "bytes": 780}